/surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Whitehorn</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Woodley</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Kopala</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><article-title>Prolactin Elevation with Quetiapine</article-title><source>Am J Psy</source><year>2002</year><volume>159</volume><issue>9</issue><fpage>1608</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1176/appi.ajp.159.9.1608</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B14"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Buhagiar</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Cassar</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><article-title>Quetiapine-Induced Hyperprolactinemic Galactorrhoea in an Adolescent Male</article-title><source>German J Psych</source><year>2006</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>118</fpage><lpage>120</lpage><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.gjpsy.uni-goettingen.de/gjp-article-buhagiar.pdf">http://www.gjpsy.uni-goettingen.de/gjp-article-buhagiar.pdf</ext-link></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>